<body bgcolor="#990000" text="#FFFFFF" link="#FFFF00" alink="#FFFF00" vlink="#FFFF00" background="../../graphics/red_bg.gif">

<b><font face="Verdana" color="#FFFF00" size="3">EQ Fame Link Directory for
EverQuest sites</font></b>
<form action="http://www.eqfame.com/cgi-bin/links.cgi" method="POST">
<input type=hidden name=script value="general">

<p><font face="Verdana" size="2">There are <b>THREE</b> ways to access the links
directory below.<br>
You can also submit new sites using the <a href="#addurl">ADD URL</a> submission
form.</font></p>
<hr>
<font color="#FFFF00"><b><font face="Verdana" size="2">1. SEARCH by Keywords</font></b></font><font face="Verdana" size="2"><font color="#FFFF00">:</font><br>
<input type="text" name="searchtext" size="60" maxlength="60"><br>
Search for documents containing <font color="#FFFF00"><b>[<input type="radio" name="searchtype" value="any" checked>ANY]
</b></font>or<font color="#FFFF00"><b> [<input type="radio" name="searchtype" value="all">ALL]</b></font>
of these words or phrases.<br>
</font>
<ul>
  <li><font face="Verdana" size="2">Separate <font color="#FFFF00"><b>multiple
    keywords</b> </font>with spaces.</font>
  <li><font face="Verdana" size="2">Enclose <b><font color="#FFFF00">phrases</font></b>
    in &quot;quotes&quot;.</font>
  <li><b><font face="Verdana" size="2" color="#FFFF00">UPPER-CASE</font></b><font face="Verdana" size="2">
    text is case-sensitive; <b><font color="#FFFF00">lower-case</font></b>
    matches either case.</font>
</ul>
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><br>
<b><input type="submit" name="search" value="START SEARCH"></b></font>
<hr>
<font color="#FFFF00"><b><font face="Verdana" size="2">2. BROWSE by Categories</font></b></font><font face="Verdana" size="2"><font color="#FFFF00">:</font><br>
</font>
<table border="1">

<tr valign=top>
<td><input type=checkbox name=category value="10">EQ Comedy and Stories</td>
<td><input type=checkbox name=category value="14">EQ Guilds all over Norrath</td>
</tr><tr valign=top>
<td><input type=checkbox name=category value="11">EQ Files and more</td>
<td><input type=checkbox name=category value="15">EQ Maps/Zones</td>
</tr><tr valign=top>
<td><input type=checkbox name=category value="12">EQ Forums and more</td>
<td><input type=checkbox name=category value="16">EQ News Sites</td>
</tr><tr valign=top>
<td><input type=checkbox name=category value="13">EQ Guides for Classes/Races and Skills</td>
<td><input type=checkbox name=category value="17">EQ Screen Shots</td>
</tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2" align="center"><b><font face="Verdana" size="2"><input type="submit" name="browse" value=" GET MY CHOICES "></font></b></td>
  </tr>
</table>
<hr>
<font color="#FFFF00"><b><font face="Verdana" size="2">3. Find ADDITIONS/CHANGES
within the past 30 days</font></b><font face="Verdana" size="2">:</font></font>
<p><b><font face="Verdana" size="2"><input type="submit" name="new" value=" WHAT's NEW? "></font></b>
<hr>
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><b><font color="#FFFF00">Do you have or know of a
website that should be included here?</font></b><br>
Please select a category and fill in all blanks below. Your submission will be
processed promptly!</font>
<p><font face="Verdana" size="2">

<select name="catnbr" size=1>
<option value="0" checked>Select A Category
<option value="10">EQ Comedy and Stories
<option value="11">EQ Files and more
<option value="12">EQ Forums and more
<option value="13">EQ Guides for Classes/Races and Skills
<option value="14">EQ Guilds all over Norrath
<option value="15">EQ Maps/Zones
<option value="16">EQ News Sites
<option value="17">EQ Screen Shots
</select>

<br>
<font color="#FFFF00">URL:</font><br>
<input type="text" name="siteurl" value="http://" size="60" maxlength="90"><br>
<font color="#FFFF00">Company or Website Name:</font><br>
<input type="text" name="title" size="60" maxlength="60"><br>
<font color="#FFFF00">Description: (Up to 255 characters - about 5 lines)</font><br>
<textarea name="description" rows="5" cols="50" wrap="VIRTUAL"></textarea><br>
<font color="#FFFF00">Your Name: (will be searchable but not visible)</font><br>
<input type="text" name="name" size="60" maxlength="60"><br>
<font color="#FFFF00">Your E-Mail address:</font><br>
<input type="text" name="email" size="60" maxlength="60"></font>
<p><a name="addurl"></a><font face="Verdana" size="2">Review your input then <b><font color="#FFFF00">PRESS
</font><input type="submit" name="add" value="  ADD URL  "> <font color="#FFFF00">ONCE</font></b><font color="#FFFF00">.</font>
Wait for response.</form>
</font>
<p><font face="Verdana" size="2"><a href="http://www.eqfame.com">[ Return back
